            "content": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Each oxygen has two lone pairs can donate one lone pair each to a metal. The oxygen atoms are spaced far enough apart (two carbons in between each oxygen), so all three oxygens can bond to the metal, making this ligand tridentate."
